abstract: "Integrated claim-bounded active-particle feedback surrogate package combining the original ABP-style model manuscript with the v0.2.0-v0.2.6 audit synthesis. The package preserves model equations and reconstructed diagnostics while narrowing claims to noise-window diagnostics, feedback-geometry dependence, frustration-boundary classification, rescue-stability behavior, and persistent hard boundaries inside tested toy-model settings."
